\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Come let us all unite and sing-
\par God is love!
\par While heaven and earth their praises bring-
\par God is love!
\par Let every soul from sin awake,
\par Each in his heart sweet music make,
\par And sweetly sing for Jesu's sake-
\par God is love!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O tell to earth's remotest bound-
\par God is love!
\par In Christ is full redemption found-
\par God is love!
\par His blood can cleanse our sins away;
\par His spirit turns our night to day,
\par And leads our souls with joy to say-
\par God is love!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. How happy is our portion here-
\par God is love!
\par His promises our spirit cheer-
\par God is love!
\par He is our Sun and Shield by day,
\par By night He near our tents will stay,
\par He will be with us all the way-
\par God is love!
\par \pard\tx7920 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. In Zion we shall sing again
\par God is love
\par Yes, this shall be our highest strain
\par God is love
\par Whilst endless ages roll along
\par In concert with the heavenly throng,
\par This shall be still our sweetest song
\par God is love
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

